{
 "note": "Mac OS 9.0.4 from the Mac OS 9 retail CD, for the PowerPC machine: Mac OS 9 Install run from 8.6 onto a blank disk (the 8.6 boot disk renamed Bootstrap), the standard install, Apple hard disk driver update off; then the Mac OS 9.0.4 Update from the same CD onto it; first boot from the new disk alone, the Mac OS Setup Assistant quit unanswered.",
 "kind": "os",
 "version": "9.0.4",
 "os": "os-8.6",
